DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261029
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:ECB monetary-policy decision
DESCRIPTION:How are euro-area financing and demand conditions changing?\nIn
 spect: Decision\, financing discussion and later bank lending data.\nImpro
 vement: Credit availability and real demand improve.\nDeterioration: Tight
 er financing coincides with weaker demand.\nLimits: Euro-area conditions d
 o not substitute for monetary conditions outside the euro area or for a sp
 ecific employer's finances.\nCheck date: 2026-09-24\nOutcome status: not_o
 bserved\nhttps://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/calendars/mgcgc/html/index.en.htm
 l
