DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261105
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261106
SUMMARY:US Q3 preliminary productivity and costs
DESCRIPTION:Are gains visible beyond task-level AI demonstrations?\nInspect
 : Output\, hours\, productivity and unit labour costs\; compare later revi
 sions.\nImprovement: Output per hour improves alongside firm-level evidenc
 e of delivered value.\nDeterioration: Firm claims lack supporting output g
 ains or costs absorb the benefit.\nLimits: Aggregate productivity cannot b
 y itself identify AI's contribution.\nCheck date: 2026-09-24\nOutcome stat
 us: not_observed\nhttps://www.bls.gov/schedule/2026/11_sched.htm
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
