DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261111
SUMMARY:EIA November energy outlook
DESCRIPTION:How do the October forecast assumptions compare with the next o
 bservations?\nInspect: Same physical supply\, inventory and household-cost
  measures as October.\nImprovement: Observed supply and inventory conditio
 ns improve across releases.\nDeterioration: Forecasts repeatedly postpone 
 improvements or depend on new unsupported assumptions.\nLimits: Keep obser
 vation periods distinct from publication dates.\nCheck date: 2026-09-24\nO
 utcome status: not_observed\nhttps://www.eia.gov/outlooks/steo/release_sch
 edule.php
