DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261125
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261126
SUMMARY:US Q3 second GDP estimate and corporate profits
DESCRIPTION:Do profits and revised output support earlier growth claims?\nI
 nspect: Revisions\, sectoral profit detail and consistency with company ca
 sh flows.\nImprovement: Broader profits and cash generation accompany grow
 th.\nDeterioration: Profit weakness or downward revisions accompany financ
 ing strain.\nLimits: National corporate profits do not establish standalon
 e profitability of private frontier labs.\nCheck date: 2026-09-24\nOutcome
  status: not_observed\nhttps://www.bea.gov/news/schedule/full
