DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261208
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261209
SUMMARY:EIA December energy outlook
DESCRIPTION:What changed in the medium-term energy outlook?\nInspect: Compa
 re successive supply and demand assumptions with observed delivery.\nImpro
 vement: Repeated physical improvement supports the forward path.\nDeterior
 ation: Repeated postponement leaves the forward path dependent on unresolv
 ed disruption.\nLimits: Retain each vintage rather than replacing an earli
 er forecast silently.\nCheck date: 2026-09-24\nOutcome status: not_observe
 d\nhttps://www.eia.gov/outlooks/steo/release_schedule.php
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
