DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261209
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261210
SUMMARY:FOMC decision and projections after 8-9 December meeting
DESCRIPTION:Has the balance of inflation\, employment and financing risk ch
 anged?\nInspect: Decision\, projections and subsequent borrowing terms.\nI
 mprovement: Inflation pressure eases with resilient demand and financing a
 ccess.\nDeterioration: Persistent inflation combines with weaker activity 
 or credit tightening.\nLimits: Committee projections are conditional views
 \, not promises.\nCheck date: 2026-09-24\nOutcome status: not_observed\nht
 tps://www.federalreserve.gov/monetarypolicy/fomccalendars.htm
