DTSTAMP:20260924T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261217
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261218
SUMMARY:ECB monetary-policy decision
DESCRIPTION:What do financing and demand conditions imply for European empl
 oyers?\nInspect: Decision and financing outlook\; examine individual emplo
 yers' finances and vacancies separately.\nImprovement: Financing and deman
 d improve across relevant employer markets.\nDeterioration: Tighter credit
  or weaker demand affects the employers being assessed.\nLimits: A macroec
 onomic release cannot establish an individual employer's finances\, vacanc
 ies or hiring timetable.\nCheck date: 2026-09-24\nOutcome status: not_obse
 rved\nhttps://www.ecb.europa.eu/press/calendars/mgcgc/html/index.en.html
